      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n    - User should be allowed to create account in our application\n    - Users can upload (resumed/disconnected) and download files of various size\n    - Changes sync across all devices automatically\n    - User should be able to share files/folders with other users (with permission)\n    - User should be able to - Create, delete, rename folders and organize files\n    - Quota / storage limit: per user quotas",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "P_WxLGm6t3qq9Nu5s-yeO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2878.60262174919,
      "y": 41692.47603366345,
      "width": 1219.8758019247214,
      "height": 540,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bELzt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1184350804,
      "version": 647,
      "versionNonce": 1940145323,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778475166125,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non Functional Requirements\n    - Scale: Millions of users/ Billions of files\n    - CAP Theorem: availability >> Consistency\n      (Eventual consistency for sync, strong consistency for metadata)\n    - System should support large files.\n    - Latency to upload should be minimal\n    - Secure and durable (No data loss)\n\n    High availability: upload/download/sync APIs should be highly available\n    Fault tolerance\n    Rate limiting\n    Observability",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non Functional Requirements\n    - Scale: Millions of users/ Billions of files\n    - CAP Theorem: availability >> Consistency\n      (Eventual consistency for sync, strong consistency for metadata)\n    - System should support large files.\n    - Latency to upload should be minimal\n    - Secure and durable (No data loss)\n\n    High availability: upload/download/sync APIs should be highly available\n    Fault tolerance\n    Rate limiting\n    Observability",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3Hv81EQwEQnE1fiawdg3f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9365.12300774919,
      "y": 41857.29043566345,
      "width": 1390.1395263671875,
      "height": 720,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bELzx",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 356984302,
      "version": 715,
      "versionNonce": 367722158,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778266629924,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-Functional Requirement:\n- Scale: 200M users, 10k videos(~1hour each)\n\nViewers:\n- CAP Theorem: Availability >>> consistency (99.9999%)\n- user should see the video with zero or negligible buffering\n- user should be able to see best quality video possible\n\nContent creator:\n- Security: Prevent unauthorized access.\n- Storage reliability: Uploaded videos should be highly durable and should not be lost\n\nHigh availability:\n    Fault tolerance\n    Rate limiting\n    Observability",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-Functional Requirement:\n- Scale: 200M users, 10k videos(~1hour each)\n\nViewers:\n- CAP Theorem: Availability >>> consistency (99.9999%)\n- user should see the video with zero or negligible buffering\n- user should be able to see best quality video possible\n\nContent creator:\n- Security: Prevent unauthorized access.\n- Storage reliability: Uploaded videos should be highly durable and should not be lost\n\nHigh availability:\n    Fault tolerance\n    Rate limiting\n    Observability",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
